# UI rules (mandatory)

Full rules: **[docs/ui-rules.md](../../docs/ui-rules.md)**.

## Tokens & spacing
- Spacing/gap/padding/margin: only `var(--space-*)` (4/8 scale) or `0`; borders `1px` OK.
- Colours in feature SCSS: only `var(--rs-*)` or design tokens — no hex/rgb literals.
- z-index: only `var(--z-*)`. Type: `var(--text-*)`. Radii: token scale or `--rs-*-radius`.
- Control heights: `--control-h-sm/md/lg`; tap targets ≥ 44px.

## Layout
- Parent sets sibling spacing with `gap` (Stack/Cluster/grid). No margins on children except `margin-inline: auto`.
- Card/row inner padding: `--space-3` or `--space-4` on all sides.
- Modal/header titles: `1fr auto 1fr` grid; overflow text: `min-width: 0` + ellipsis/wrap.

## Primitives (`src/shared/ui`)
Use shared Modal, Sheet, SegmentedControl, Button, Field, Stack, etc. — extend via props, never fork locally.
2–4 options → SegmentedControl; no hand-built modals/headers in feature code.

## Mobile-first
Design for 360px first; `min-width` breakpoints 480/768/1024/1280 only. No horizontal scroll at 360.

## Loading & verification
Skeleton on first paint — no "Загрузка…" placeholders. Changed screens: Playwright `toHaveScreenshot` at 360/390/768/1280, `maxDiffPixelRatio: 0.01`, baselines committed.
